{"id": "flp-map-001", "type": "lecture_index", "title": "《费曼物理学讲义》三卷地图", "text": "官方在线版分为三卷：第一卷以力学、辐射与热为主，第二卷以电磁学与物质为主，第三卷讨论量子力学。教学时先判断问题属于哪一卷，再取具体章节；不要把讲义的编排误说成现代课程唯一的学习顺序。", "tags": ["费曼物理学讲义", "三卷", "学习路线", "力学", "热学", "电磁学", "量子力学"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 91, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "6487ae4f4da6aae0"}
{"id": "flp-i-01", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第一卷第1章：运动中的原子", "text": "把物质想成不停运动并彼此作用的原子，是连接温度、压强、蒸发和化学反应的共同直觉。可从一滴水或香味扩散开始，让学习者先猜微粒怎样运动；边界是原子图景不能替代量子理论，也不能把微观粒子画成缩小的硬球。", "tags": ["原子", "分子运动", "温度", "压强", "扩散", "第一卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/I_01.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 98, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "9bc3b0e674bd7600"}
{"id": "flp-i-04", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第一卷第4章：能量守恒", "text": "能量像一套总账：形式可以变，若系统边界和相互作用记全，总量保持不变。可用玩具积木被藏进不同盒子的故事建立直觉，再区分动能、势能、热和场能；守恒不是说每一种能量都分别不变，也不是忽略开放系统与外界交换。", "tags": ["能量", "能量守恒", "动能", "势能", "系统边界", "第一卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/I_04.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 100, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "83484ac946e57dd3"}
{"id": "flp-i-06", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第一卷第6章：概率与随机游走", "text": "概率描述重复试验中可检验的分布，不是替无知起一个漂亮名字。可用醉汉每步随机向左或向右的随机游走，让学习者猜走很多步后典型距离如何增长；独立同分布情形下尺度约随步数平方根增长，但相关步骤或偏置会改变结论。", "tags": ["概率", "随机游走", "涨落", "分布", "平方根", "第一卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/I_06.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 101, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "ec280fafcd8b2a47"}
{"id": "flp-i-07", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第一卷第7章：万有引力", "text": "同一个平方反比规律把地面落体与行星轨道连在一起，核心关系可写成 F=Gm1m2/r^2。可先问月亮为何没有掉下来，再把轨道理解为持续下落却不断错过地面；公式适用于经典弱场近似，强引力和高精度问题需要广义相对论。", "tags": ["引力", "万有引力", "轨道", "开普勒", "平方反比", "第一卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/I_07.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [{"kind": "quantity", "value": 1.0, "unit": "m", "dimension": [0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], "base_factor": 1.0, "dim_name": "m", "ambiguous": true, "span": [36, 38], "quote": "1m"}], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 105, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 1, "quantity_mentions": 1, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "059b465bca082fd9"}
{"id": "flp-i-09", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第一卷第9章：牛顿动力学", "text": "动力学不只是背 F=ma，更一般的结构是力决定动量变化率 F=dp/dt。可让学习者比较推空购物车和满购物车，再追问质量、速度与参考系；恒定质量且低速时才可直接写成 F=ma，接近光速时要保留动量的相对论形式。", "tags": ["牛顿定律", "力学", "力", "动量", "加速度", "第一卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/I_09.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 105, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "a276970f4ec7d95e"}
{"id": "flp-i-15", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第一卷第15至16章：狭义相对论与能量动量", "text": "相对论的起点不是物体神秘地变形，而是所有惯性观察者都使用同一套物理规律，并测得相同光速。比较车头与车尾的运动前要先固定惯性参考系，再用洛伦兹速度变换；动能则是 K=(γ-1)mc²，在低速极限才近似为 mv²/2。能量与动量满足 E²=p²c²+m²c⁴。", "tags": ["狭义相对论", "光速", "参考系", "速度变换", "相对论动能", "洛伦兹因子", "低速近似", "能量动量关系", "第一卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/I_15.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 128, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "c897013277a6a4a0"}
{"id": "flp-i-44", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第一卷第44章：热力学定律与熵", "text": "熵首先是状态量，热力学定义可由可逆路径上的 dS=dQ_rev/T 理解；统计解释则把熵与兼容同一宏观状态的微观可能数联系起来。可从冷热物体接触后为何不会自发恢复温差开始；不要把熵简单说成脏乱，也不要把局部熵降低误当成违反第二定律，必须看系统与环境的总变化。", "tags": ["热力学", "熵", "第二定律", "可逆过程", "温度", "第一卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/I_44.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 129, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "a4beb95c5e221ee0"}
{"id": "flp-i-46", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第一卷第46章：棘轮、不可逆性与热涨落", "text": "棘轮与棘爪说明仅凭热涨落不能从单一温度的平衡系统持续取功：棘爪自己也会热运动。可让学习者先设计一台只靠分子碰撞转动的小机器，再找出被漏算的自由度；若存在温差，系统就不再是单一热平衡，结论的条件随之改变。", "tags": ["棘轮", "不可逆性", "热涨落", "热机", "熵", "第一卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/I_46.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 101, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "5c7327bf6b309b21"}
{"id": "flp-i-47", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第一卷第47至49章：波、拍频与正常模", "text": "波动把局部振动传到邻近位置；两个频率接近的波叠加会出现拍频，受边界限制的系统只允许某些正常模。可用两把略微走音的乐器听见拍频，再从弦或空气柱的边界条件找允许频率；线性叠加只在线性近似中成立。", "tags": ["波", "声波", "波动方程", "拍频", "正常模", "第一卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/I_47.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 95, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "e302e3982ab667cc"}
{"id": "flp-i-49-pitch", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第一卷第49章：正常模、音调与响度", "text": "撞击更强通常先让振动振幅增大，听起来更响；它不自动提高振动频率，因此不能从声音更响推出音调更尖。音调主要跟频率对应，而允许的固有频率由材料、形状、尺寸、边界条件和正常模决定；很强的非线性撞击或接触条件变化才可能同时改变频谱。", "tags": ["声音", "音调", "响度", "频率", "振幅", "固有频率", "正常模", "撞击", "第一卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/I_49.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 112, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "a85c6f3eb47801d5"}
{"id": "flp-ii-01", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第二卷第1章：电磁相互作用", "text": "正负电荷之间巨大的电磁作用在普通物质中大体抵消，因此宏观物体常显得近似中性。可从梳子摩擦后吸纸屑开始，区分净电荷、极化和接地；静电现象只是电磁场在时间不变或缓慢变化条件下的一部分。", "tags": ["电磁学", "电荷", "静电", "极化", "第二卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/II_01.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 90, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "eed32d403853a068"}
{"id": "flp-ii-04", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第二卷第4章：静电场与高斯定律", "text": "静电场可由电荷分布与边界条件决定；高斯定律把闭合面上的电通量与内部净电荷联系起来。可先比较球形、柱形和平面对称分布，问哪种高斯面会让计算真正变简单；高斯定律始终成立，但只有足够对称时才会直接给出场强。", "tags": ["静电场", "高斯定律", "电通量", "电势", "对称性", "第二卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/II_04.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 100, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "05bd3d9341ae548c"}
{"id": "flp-ii-17", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第二卷第17章：电磁感应", "text": "变化的磁环境与回路中的感应电动势有关，但把一切都背成简单的磁通量规则会漏掉运动回路与时变电场的区别。可用磁铁穿过线圈的实验，让学习者分别改变磁铁、线圈和速度；方向由楞次定律体现能量守恒，具体计算要先说清回路和参考系。", "tags": ["电磁感应", "法拉第定律", "楞次定律", "磁通量", "第二卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/II_17.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 108, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "2e354f972db1b154"}
{"id": "flp-ii-18", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第二卷第18章：麦克斯韦方程与光", "text": "麦克斯韦方程把电荷、电流、电场与磁场放进一个相互耦合的结构，时变电场产生磁场这一项使自由空间中的电磁波成为可能，并给出传播速度 c。可从给电容器充电时导线中的电流去了哪里开始；方程的微分形式需要连续场近似，材料响应还要另给本构关系。", "tags": ["麦克斯韦方程", "电磁波", "光速", "位移电流", "第二卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/II_18.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 116, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "e37a433b897b4d22"}
{"id": "flp-ii-19", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第二卷第19章：最小作用量原理", "text": "真实路径让作用量的一阶变化为零，更准确地说是驻值而不保证总是最小；写成符号是 δS=0。可让学习者比较附近几条路径，观察微小改动为何不会在一阶改变作用量；它不是说粒子预先知道终点，也不是所有路径都取同样概率。", "tags": ["最小作用量", "作用量", "驻值", "变分原理", "第二卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/II_19.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 104, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "80b898a8779e6014"}
{"id": "flp-iii-01", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第三卷第1章：量子行为与双缝", "text": "量子对象不能被经典小球或经典波完整代替；在理想实验中先组合概率幅，再取绝对值平方得到概率 P=|φ|^2。可用电子双缝让学习者预测开一条缝、开两条缝和获取路径信息时的图样；测量不是偷看而已，它改变了实验条件与可区分信息。", "tags": ["量子行为", "双缝", "概率幅", "干涉", "测量", "第三卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/III_01.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 110, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "8f50b1c590d266e5", "retrieval_boost": 20}
{"id": "flp-iii-03", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第三卷第3章：概率幅的组合", "text": "互不相干的可区分方案通常加概率，无法区分的量子替代方案要先加复概率幅再平方，因此会出现干涉项。可用两条路线到同一探测器的相位箭头做纸上实验；一旦环境留下可获取的路径信息，简单的相干叠加会被削弱。", "tags": ["概率幅", "干涉", "相位", "可区分路径", "第三卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/III_03.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 97, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "4c4b9212b18998da", "retrieval_boost": 12}
{"id": "flp-iii-08", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第三卷第8至10章：二态系统与哈密顿矩阵", "text": "许多量子问题可以先压缩成两个基态及其耦合，哈密顿矩阵决定概率幅如何随时间变化。可用氨分子在两个构型间的振荡或两个相连杯子的类比建立节奏，再指出经典液体没有复相位；二态近似只有在其他能级足够远或不被显著激发时可靠。", "tags": ["二态系统", "哈密顿矩阵", "氨分子", "能级", "第三卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/III_08.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 106, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "98061e17908bc953"}
{"id": "flp-iii-17", "type": "lecture_card", "title": "第三卷第17章：对称性与守恒律", "text": "对称性意味着改变描述方式后物理预测不变，并与守恒律有深刻联系：时间平移对应能量守恒，空间平移对应动量守恒，旋转对称对应角动量守恒。可让学习者找出实验装置旋转或平移后哪些读数不该变；实际系统若受外界作用，必须把更大的封闭系统纳入。", "tags": ["对称性", "守恒律", "能量", "动量", "角动量", "第三卷"], "source": "https://www.feynmanlectures.caltech.edu/III_17.html", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 114, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "5a4c492b0f708dc1"}
